 "nl": [
  "Deny all traffic from iot-sensors to research (this overrides any public service).",
  "Hosts in ntp-servers may reach mail over NTP (UDP 123) and DNS over UDP 53 and RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "Hosts in guest-wifi may reach admin over DNS over UDP 53 and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "iot-sensors may use any TCP port towards research, except FTP (TCP 21), RDP (TCP 3389), which must be blocked.",
  "Restrict nvr so that its only permitted destinations are mail on DNS over UDP 53; printers on NTP (UDP 123); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "nvr may use TCP ports 1024-65535 towards printers, except RDP (TCP 3389), PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), which must be blocked.",
  "ntp-servers must accept HTTPS (TCP 443) and HTTP (TCP 80) from mail.",
  "Hosts in ntp-servers may reach mail over DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Restrict mail so that its only permitted destinations are guest-wifi on NTP (UDP 123); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "guest-wifi must accept HTTPS (TCP 443) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from scada.",
  "Make HTTP (TCP 80) and DNS over UDP 53 on admin reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Hosts in nvr may reach ntp-servers over SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "iot-sensors may use any UDP port towards research, except SNMP (UDP 161), which must be blocked.",
  "guest-wifi must accept NTP (UDP 123) from mail.",
  "Any zone may connect to student-lab over HTTPS (TCP 443) and HTTP (TCP 80)."
 ],
